{"title": "Phalanx Formation", "pageid": 20580, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Phalanx_Formation", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Phalanx_Formation_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/2/20/Phalanx_Formation_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Phalanx_Formation_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Phalanx Formation</b> is a passive feature that grants bonuses if next to a Shield using ally.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> if within 3 m (10 ft) of an ally that carries a shield and isn't <a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(Condition)\" title=\"Incapacitated (Condition)\">Incapacitated</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Arensen\" title=\"Arensen\">Arensen</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Azari\" title=\"Azari\">Azari</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bella_(Bloomridge_Park)\" title=\"Bella (Bloomridge Park)\">Bella (Bloomridge Park)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Beorn_Wunterbrood\" title=\"Beorn Wunterbrood\">Beorn Wunterbrood</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Brandella\" title=\"Brandella\">Brandella</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Broadhorn\" title=\"Broadhorn\">Broadhorn</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Corlos\" title=\"Corlos\">Corlos</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Crosse\" title=\"Crosse\">Crosse</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dresten\" title=\"Dresten\">Dresten</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Duddamoor\" title=\"Duddamoor\">Duddamoor</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Elda_(Flaming_Fist)\" title=\"Elda (Flaming Fist)\">Elda (Flaming Fist)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Elthira_Gossen\" title=\"Elthira Gossen\">Elthira Gossen</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ernestus\" title=\"Ernestus\">Ernestus</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Falc%C3%A4o\" title=\"Falcäo\">Falcäo</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fernhollow\" title=\"Fernhollow\">Fernhollow</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fist_Attacker\" title=\"Fist Attacker\">Fist Attacker</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Granitdatter\" title=\"Granitdatter\">Granitdatter</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Halfar\" title=\"Halfar\">Halfar</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hextra\" title=\"Hextra\">Hextra</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Jerbold\" title=\"Jerbold\">Jerbold</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Jimi_Borleas\" title=\"Jimi Borleas\">Jimi Borleas</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Karoline\" title=\"Karoline\">Karoline</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kepso\" title=\"Kepso\">Kepso</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Klaas\" title=\"Klaas\">Klaas</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kur\" title=\"Kur\">Kur</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kuthbert\" title=\"Kuthbert\">Kuthbert</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Leythim\" title=\"Leythim\">Leythim</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Liara_Portyr\" title=\"Liara Portyr\">Liara Portyr</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lochan\" title=\"Lochan\">Lochan</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Miller\" title=\"Miller\">Miller</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nateen\" title=\"Nateen\">Nateen</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nephel\" title=\"Nephel\">Nephel</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nestor\" title=\"Nestor\">Nestor</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Orgarth\" title=\"Orgarth\">Orgarth</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Oriona\" title=\"Oriona\">Oriona</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Pantella\" title=\"Pantella\">Pantella</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Patrick\" title=\"Patrick\">Patrick</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Qirahe\" title=\"Qirahe\">Qirahe</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Quickstitch\" title=\"Quickstitch\">Quickstitch</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Saunder\" title=\"Saunder\">Saunder</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Serrik\" title=\"Serrik\">Serrik</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Shargil\" title=\"Shargil\">Shargil</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Silena\" title=\"Silena\">Silena</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Starrlet\" title=\"Starrlet\">Starrlet</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Taraji\" title=\"Taraji\">Taraji</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Thauniel_Rusk\" title=\"Thauniel Rusk\">Thauniel Rusk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Togarr\" title=\"Togarr\">Togarr</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ulder_Ravengard\" title=\"Ulder Ravengard\">Ulder Ravengard</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Virry\" title=\"Virry\">Virry</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Yeva\" title=\"Yeva\">Yeva</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_rolls\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack rolls\">attack rolls</a> within 3 m (10 ft) of an ally with a shield who isn't <a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(Condition)\" title=\"Incapacitated (Condition)\">incapacitated</a>.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715013153\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry